# CR 613.8a with reconfigure (CR 702.151b): Lion Sash enters after Ygra, so its "While attached, this isn't a creature" has
# the later timestamp. As a creature it is one of Ygra's "other creatures", a Food (the first check). Attached to Ygra, it
# isn't a creature: that changes what Ygra's effect applies to, so Ygra's effect waits for it and then does not apply - an
# Equipment that is no Food. In timestamp order Ygra's effect would have made it a Food before it stopped being a creature.

